  "title": "Apple Stuffed Pork Chops",
  "description": "Thick pork loin chops are heavenly when baked with a simple bread stuffing flavored with apples and celery. The delicious results will look like you've slaved for hours.",
  "authors": [
    "Nancy Burrowes"
  ],
